  abilityName: <color=#FFA000>Ability:\nBlade Dance</color>
  description: 'Send your <color=#FFA000>Blades</color> to target location within
    <color=#3278FF>2x Range</color>. They stay there for <color=#FFA000>3 seconds</color>
    before recalling. <color=#FFA000>Recast</color> to recall early.

    <color=#FFBE50><i>Ability
    Haste & Power grant Attack Speed during this</i>

    Cooldown: 3 seconds</color>'
